# PRODUCTION: copy to trusted-proxies.prod.conf and mount it as /etc/nginx/trusted-proxies.conf
# instead of the dev file. List ONLY the address(es) of the Next.js BFF servers that call this gateway.
# Never list whole private ranges: any caller inside a trusted range could forge X-Forwarded-For
# and dodge the per-client rate limits.
# set_real_ip_from 203.0.113.10;   # <- replace with the BFF's real address
